   "fix": "Replace the hypothesis with `(hfg : \u2200\u1d50 x \u2202\u03bc, g x = 0 \u2192 f x * O x = 0)`; the proof becomes `simp_rw [\u2190 weight_mul]; exact integral_weight hg hg_top hfg`.",
